{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121689","id":4117671580,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc71bq6c","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121689","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121689.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121689.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121689","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121689/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121689/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121689/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/320d84cb94c1562de474d9b9e9696b8cfa647da0","number":121689,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Editor: Add 2D and 3D viewport bookmarks","user":{"login":"benioriginal","id":111044589,"node_id":"U_kgDOBp5n7Q","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111044589?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/benioriginal","html_url":"https://github.com/benioriginal","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benioriginal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benioriginal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benioriginal/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benioriginal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benioriginal/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benioriginal/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benioriginal/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benioriginal/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benioriginal/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"### Problem\r\nAs suggested in [proposal discussion #12815](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/discussions/12815), for large scenes it takes a long time to navigate between different areas. A solution I and probably other developers where using was adding a Marker 3D/2D and using a shortcutt to move camera to it, however this is inconvenient and clutters the runtime scene tree.\r\n\r\n### Features\r\n- Adds a \"Bookmarks\" submenu to the view menu in both 2D and 3D editors.\r\n- Add Current view... saves and names the current viewport\r\n- Clicking a bookmark returns to that view\r\n- A management dialog that supports Go To, overwrite, rename and delete\r\n- Bookmark changes support Undo/Redo\r\n- The direct submenu is limited to 10 entries, more opens a scrollable manager (the management dialog)\r\n- Shortcuts : Ctrl/Cmd + Alt + B: add current view. Ctrl/Cmd + ]: next bookmark. Ctrl/Cmd + [: previous bookmark.\r\n- Shortcuts are configurable in Editor Setttings\r\n- 2D bookmarks store pan offset and DPI independent zoom\r\n- 3d Bookmarks store pivot position, rotation, camera distance, perspective/orthographic mode, and view type.\r\n- 3D bookmark actions are unavailable while previewing or piloting a Camera3D.\r\n\r\n### Version Control behavior\r\nThe bookmarks are stored as versioned metadata on the scene root under `_edit_viewport_bookmakrs_`, when the scene is saved, the data is written into the scene file, so bookmarks can be tracked by Git and shared across devices or team members, separate 2D and 3D lists are kept in the same metadata structure.\r\n\r\n### Technical mentions\r\nshared validation and management UI are implemented in `viewport_bookmarks.cpp` and ` viewport_bookmarks.h`, and invalid metadata entries duplicate names non finite position and invalid zoom and distance values are ignored safely.\r\nExisting metadata for the other viewport type is preserved when one collection changes, and the stored format is versioned for future compatibility\r\n\r\n### Caveats\r\nBookmarks intentionally live in scene files so teams can share them, as requested in the proposal discussion, however this may create scene file diffs for editor only navigation changes, this is intentional but I dont know if this is the preffered persistance location.\r\nI also tought about implementing Folders/Tags but maybe in a future implementation, I wanted not to overcomplicate this first version.\r\n### AI disclosure\r\nAI assistance was used for menial things like code completion, I made sure not to use it again for the PR after I found out its not allowed and I agree with it.\r\n\r\nedit: Forgot to add some videos\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/451a0a47-f282-47e4-8209-95b826e9744e\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2766e54e-0681-4d7c-a4e0-b0390480b470\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followe